{"id":"vod_sn_38567","vodId":"38567","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"盖亚奥特曼","name_cn":"盖亚奥特曼","date":"1998-01-01","year":"1998","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/678598e82fb33b518ea34e6337e99f5d.jpg"},"summary":"1997年，超级电脑炼金之星预测到地球将会破坏招来体所消灭。得知此事后人类用炼金之星的研究技术组成一个全球防御组织GUARD，而XIG则是GUARD的战斗力量。　　2000年，天才少年·高山我梦在一次试验中见到神秘的红色光之巨人。当破坏招来体第一次进攻的时侯，XIG起不到作用。此时，我梦坠入光之隧道，并再次看见巨人，他希望巨人能赐予力量保卫地球。于是，巨人与我梦合二为一，并与破坏招来体展开了战斗。　　在战胜破坏招来体之后，我梦加入了XIG，而巨人则被命名为“盖亚”。但此时，另一名青年·藤宫博也亦拥有着变身成巨人“阿古茹”的力量。两个巨人与破坏招来体将会展开一连串的战斗。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ru2dJT7dqd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ELm1JrAg0q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zf1PnNzLCz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/evwrNNP80E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RCa60dXG731/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZiguBvPZJt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SCnYvxgnL61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yhpxTeZFJc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zCM2zyY0Ax1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nitpnyaQde1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Xsxd4gip9Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PVkhABn97i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WdFJVVNenZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YcTypcj6qK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15